    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34050" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβριθ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρίθω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weighty</i>, of ropes, <i><span class="en">
