			ὀξεῖς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				144b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>weighty, cogent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεκμήριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.46
