			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάνοια</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.209
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). Adv.
